{"id":"dcc15554-5fb7-4b64-8053-e2f7c1670505","object":"chat.completion","created":1795147563,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT COUNT(*) AS products_without_price_change\nFROM products p\nWHERE NOT EXISTS (\n  SELECT 1\n  FROM product_price_history h\n  WHERE h.product_id = p.product_id\n);","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答：有多少个商品从来没有发生过价格变动？需要SQL。Schema有 products, product_price_history。需要计数商品（products）中没有出现在 price_history 的 product_id。需要确定商品总数来自 products。计数 DISTINCT product_id? products主键唯一。可以 SELECT COUNT(*) FROM products p WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM product_price_history h WHERE h.product_id=p.product_id). 需要LIMIT? 规则3：单行无GROUP BY的COUNT/SUM/AVG等聚合除外，所以可以不加LIMIT。 输出列名 maybe products_without_price_change。 简洁。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2826,"completion_tokens":169,"total_tokens":2995,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2688},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":127},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2688,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":138},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}